<title>JAPAN: Kinseki -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Kinseki -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 16.02		vs	   16.06</p>
<p> Operating	  672    million	  vs	  689    million</p>
<p> Current	    965    million	  vs	  968    million</p>
<p> Net		  663    million	  vs	  415    million</p>
<p> EPS		   20.63 yen	  vs	   12.92 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     32 million	  vs	  32 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  5.00 yen	  vs	    5.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Kinseki Ltd is a manufacturer of crystal equipment.</p>
</text>
